    ('GCUKIP/2022/059', '2026-04-21', 'The doctor is currently experiencing delays in communication regarding updates for the blog from the tech team. It has been two weeks since the last status update was received. The doctor has expressed the need for more direct access to updates, as past communication has typically come directly from designated contacts, creating a gap in timely information transfer.\n\n\n\nDELAYS IN COMMUNICATION  \n\nThe doctor has not received updates from the tech team for two weeks.  \nThe last communication about the blog was initiated by the doctor.\n\n\nHOURS OF COMMUNICATION  \n\nThe doctor mentioned receiving communication about 11 hours prior to the conversation.\n\n\nREDIRECTED COMMUNICATION  \n\nUpdates are being rerouted through the organization\'s website and email, limiting direct access for the doctor.  \n  \n\nREQUEST FOR FOLLOW-UP  \n\nThe doctor expressed a willingness to follow up directly if given the appropriate contact information.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
