    ('GCUKIP/2023/035', '2026-03-31', '* Client facing issues with GMC application related to primary medical qualification\n\n* Concerns about verification of clinical rotations and internship details\n\n* COVID period training may not meet UK standard requirements\n\n* Discrepancies in documentation compared to classmates working in NHS\n\n* Uncertainty about clock hours, qualifications, and required letters\n\n* Needs clarity on clinical rotation breakdown and UK criteria alignment\n\n* Advised that EPIC only verifies documents, not curriculum standards\n\n* Plan to review application details and share sample format\n\n* Client to obtain supporting documents/letter from college\n\n* Follow-up planned after internal discussion with team', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
