    ('GCUKIP/25-26/003', '2025-05-30', 'He is currently in Qatar\nWill be coming to India on the 11th of June\nHe is interested in Surgery\nHe has a surgical procedure in June for which he need a month to recover', 'poornima_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/078', '2025-05-28', '- Asked him how the exam went in the UK\n- He said \'Speaking was different and we need to speak fast and counter questions are more here. In India speaking is simply easy\'\n- Listening is also different. Because here they are not providing any headsets, they played the audio in a speaker for whole class. So need more concentration.\n- Reading writing same', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/003', '2025-05-28', '- He came to the office\n- Will be having a lasik surgery this June\n- Won\'t be able to do anything for the whole month \n- He said he will start with research in July, audit and the BMJ in July \n- Wants to do the ALS course in October \n- He has his sisters wedding in October \n- Wants to take up the PLAB2 exam in Jan or Feb \n- Wants to apply for IMT next year \n- Told him we\'ll help him with it\n- He has asthma so he said he won\'t go to the UK in December', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/028', '2025-05-28', 'We discussed and we decided that he will say that there were nothing online for his internship or during his MBBS\nWill be setting up his GMC account tomorrow', 'poornima_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/028', '2025-05-27', 'He did his internship in India from Indira hospital from for 5 months\nPart of his internship was online\nOne of his friends applied for her GMC license\nAwaiting response\nHe said he will wait for her license to come and then we can do his GMC account accordingly', 'poornima_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/012', '2025-05-26', '- He is in Qatar\n- He said he will be coming back to India in the first week of June \n- Will take up a job here in the same place where he worked for about 1 year and 3 months \n- He said he will work here again, get his CREST form signed \n- Also do an audit and teaching sessions in his hospiital \n- He wants our help to publish his research \n- He will pay for it \n- He he two other papers too but that\'ll take sometime \n- He finished the audit couirse\n- He said he will do the ALS in October \n- Will try to attend or present in the ICOPH conference \n- Told him we\'ll give him sessions with Vasu later on after he has something on his CV', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/003', '2025-05-26', '- Will be coming to the office this week\n- We\'ll discuss portfolio then', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/044', '2025-05-26', 'His plan (as of today) OET on June 28th\nInternship will start by the end of this year\nPLAB1 during his internship\nPLAB2 after his internship before his exam OET expires (June 27\')\nPortfolio all in between', 'poornima_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/24-25/036', '2025-05-26', 'June - Audit, Research, Research program, Conference\nJuly - 2 RCOG courses\nAugust - ICOPH conference (maybe)\nShe will then decide by when she can take the PLAB2 and the MRCOG part 2', 'poornima_goocampus'),
