    ('GCUKIP/24-25/004', '2024-08-12', 'He Informed me this,  "Regarding the status of OET classes for this month alternate sessions of reading, listening and writing are been done and full sessions in next month that includes speaking daily as we have time and the sessions from Monday to Friday.\n- Told him to inform me in prior when he wants us to book his exam.\n- Wants to take up OET, computer based.', 'nihal_goocampus'),
