    ('GCUKIP/2023/015', '2024-08-09', '- She came back to India yesterday \n- Finished only 2 weeks out of the 4 weeks attachment \n- Her father asked her to come back because the riots were happening \n- Told her we\'ll discuss about her portfolio and we\'ll see what she can do', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
