    ('GCUKIP/23-24/086', '2024-08-08', '- Wants to postpone his PLAB1 to Feb 2025 \n- Because he has his FMGE classes from 9 - 8 in the night until October\n- November and December he has revision classes\n- I suggested postponing to Feb so he might have more time \n- Said he will speak to the mother and let us know', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
