    ('GCUKIP/2022/010', '2023-11-09', 'Didnt get a slot yet. The agent called her few days back when they secured a slot for her for 20 Jan. But unfortunately she was not avaialble to attend the call and she lost the slot. \n\nShe started her attachement 2 days ago. \n\nShe started taking INSHA PLAB 2 course. She said the course is good.\n\nShe couldnt attend live but went through the recorded session.\n\nSometimes the classes will be afternoon sometimes at evening. if its evening she can attend. \n\nWaiting for PLAB 2 slot before her visa expires. if she gets a slot she might end her attachment a week before and take some time to prepare for PLAB 2 .\n\nThe feedback what she gave about Aspire is no one is there to guide you after the classes. \n\nHard to find Ankur and Nikhil after the classes. now it has changed. they have a supervised practise.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/034', '2023-11-09', 'EPIC rejected stating that they will only allow case by case. \n\nAsked him to call GMC and get the pmq1 form and contact college . \n\nTold him that we will refund 50000 regarding his accommodation refund. \n\nCLEARLY MENTIONED THAT ITS GOOCAMPUS WHO IS REFUNDING NOT ASPIRE.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
