    ('GCUKIP/2021/040', '2023-07-20', '- Said everything is going well \n- He wanted to do some teaching sessions but can\'t get online feedback \n- He said he wants some guidance on how he can start an audit in his hospital \n- I told him we\'ll soon conduct a mentorship session and we\'ll let him know about it \n- He was speaking about the gateway program that recruits doctors into the NHS', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
