    ('GCUKIP/2022/052', '2023-07-20', '- Had some doubts about the audit which he\'s doing in his hospital \n- He has the certificate but he wanted the QIP tool format \n- I have aksed him to get a format from his hospital and then we\'ll let him know if its fine \n- Preparation for PLAB1 is going well \n- Finished 1 revision of Plabable and Plabkeys \n- Will let us know when he starts taking mocks', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/008', '2023-07-20', '- Asked her organization for letters but she didn\'t get a response and couldn\'t follow up too because she had her theory exams\n- She said her practicals are from next Tuesday and she will let me know how it went', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/050', '2023-07-20', '- Said he\'s preapring for PLAB1 \n- He likes Arora, using Plabkeys too. Will soon start mocks in Plabable \n- He said he will let us know when he starts mocks \n- He wanted to speak to Vipin about the research program', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
