    ('GCUKIP/2021/011', '2023-07-19', 'Got shortlisted for an interview.\nLuton in london.\n\nMock interview is happening today.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/008', '2023-07-19', 'wanted to know about cab booking. - explained. \n\nbriefed what doc to carry.\n\nShould motivate her to study\n\nShould follow up each week\n\nBooking cab for her today.\n\nShe didnt start studying.\n\nShe didnt attend the online coaching. didnt get time. she was working and traveling. \n\nGoing to take mo sobhy training then aspire.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/037', '2023-07-19', '- Did not clear the IELTS exam\n- Said she likes preparing by herself and practicing with her sister \n- Said she went blank while she went to the exam hall \n- She prepared well\n- Couldn\'t manage time but feels comfortable with the pen and paper based exam \n- Will let us know when she wants to take the next exam', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
