    ('GCUKIP/2022/004', '2023-07-19', '- Work is little hectic, starting with some production work now \n- She said she\'s preparing well for PLAB1\n- She\'ll start taking mocks by Sept\n- Still has access to Plabable, Plabkeys, Arora \n- Research too is going okay and she is okay with everything and is aware of what\'s happening', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
