    ('GCUKIP/2021/002', '2023-07-19', '- PLAB1 preparation is going well\n- He was asking about the research program \n- Said he\'ll let us know if he needs anything \n- He said he\'ll apply for the VISA in the month of September', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/090', '2023-07-19', '- Started his internship on July 16th \n- Will take a break from today till August 19th to prepare for his PLAB1 in November \n- He said he has a hectic posting now so he took a break \n- Doing his internship in a Govt hospital in Surat \n- He said he\'ll start taking mock tests soon and inform me of the scores', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
