    ('GCUKIP/2021/043', '2023-07-18', '- Will take his OET exam on Sept 2nd \n- He will then try to booka PLAB1 for the earliest date even if it is in another country like UAE, Bangladesh\n- Will let us know when he books his OET', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2021/072', '2023-07-18', '- He said he attended the session with Dr. Urvish and they will be working on another submission if the current one doesn\'t get accepted \n- He was asking if the registrations are open for ATLS \n- He wanted to do so,me teaching sessions for OET \n- He wanted to know how many days  the ASICON conference he can attend', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2021/025', '2023-07-18', '- Said she applied for around 70 jobs \n- Told her to apply for some jobs which we\'ll be sending today \n- She was asking if others too are getting jobs', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
