    ('GCUKIP/2022/091', '2023-07-18', '- Was asking for an update about the research program and we said we\'ll have a session soon with Dr. Urvish\n- Other than that PLAB1 prep is good \n- He took his first mock in Plabable and scored 107 \n- I told him mock scores will increase as he atttempts more mocks \n- Asked him to use all the resources which we have provided \n- I told him that Eintegrity will expire in Jan next year so he can do it after his PLAB1 exam', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
