    ('GCUKIP/2023/035', '2023-07-17', '- Called to ask about when she wants to book IELTS \n- No response', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/033', '2023-07-17', '- Wanted to start her IELTS classes today \n- Will ask Parth to call her', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/046', '2023-07-17', '- Said he cannot attend the live classes by Arora as he is busy \n- Said he might not pass the PLAB1 exam as he and his wife are working 2 jobs, taking care of their 1 year old kid and sisters kid \n- His English scores are expiring in July 2024 \n- He wants to take it in November or Feb if possible', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/038', '2023-07-17', '- Wanted an update about the research program \n- I told him that we\'ll arrange a session this week and he can clear his doubts \n- He also said that he\'s doing an audit in Ortho in his hospital \n- He wanted some help with it', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/042', '2023-07-17', '- Wants to book his OET exam \n- Will speak to Parth and get it booked', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/041', '2023-07-17', '- Was busy \n- Said he\'ll call later', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/034', '2023-07-17', '- Still didn\'t complete the Teaching course \n- I have informed her that she needs to finish the teaching course soon and then we\'ll give her access to the next course', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/037', '2023-07-17', '- Has unlocked her GMC account', 'ralph_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2021/010', '2023-07-17', 'Accommodation is fine. Okaish\n\nToilet was not clean, Flush was not working, Kitchen was messy. less space in the refrigator.\n\nDidnt buy a sim, will buy it today. \n\nToday the classes are starting. \n\nWill call me in the eve', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2020/031', '2023-07-17', 'Everything is going good. Life is great in UK\n\nStarted reading books\n\nHe got the best room in the accommodation, he said it looks like a honeymoon suite.\n\nHe will shift to another room soon cos he is a kanju\'s. \n\nHe will tell me whether he wants mo shoby mocks. \n\nHe asked for arora mocks but convinced that we have given him arora golden package which is additional.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/055', '2023-07-17', 'She want us to pay for the accommodation. and she will reimburse. \n\nShe failed the als assessment . waiting to take the next assessment  on 19th.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2023/025', '2023-07-17', 'She was busy .\nshe said she will be calling back.', 'bhavana_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/2021/081', '2023-07-17', 'Called him regarding postal address.', 'bhavana_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/2021/023', '2023-07-16', 'Visa got rejected. \n\nReason  for rejection is he forgot to attach PLAB 1 result sheet. \n\nWants to re apply for VISA\n\nMa\'am wants to talk to him', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2021/061', '2023-07-14', 'Got a job offer from Bapio\n\nHe was Happy to hear that \n\nHe wanted to know his salary\n\nHe said he will send the testimonial video and google review', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/047', '2023-07-14', 'got his GMC license\n\nGot job offer from somerset where he did observership \n\nHe got job from his connections.\n\nAdvised us to ask candidates to do more observerships and make connections.\n\nCompetition is really high to get a job. 1:250 is the ratio of people applying for jobs.  1 post 250 people will apply. \n\nhe will give a google review and testimonial video also\n\nWanted to do his journey session with kanika\n\ngot few more interviews. not sure whether will attend. \n\ngot one more interview from same trust which shyam adviced not to attend.', 'jeswin_goocampus1'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/035', '2023-07-14', '- Called her regarding the Audit course.\n- She wants to take the course when she starts working.', 'bhavana_goocampus'),
    ('GCUKIP/2022/043', '2023-07-14', 'She will take the Audit course if its after 10th August.', 'bhavana_goocampus'),
